abstract: "Research prototype exposing simulated and software-reference IEEE 11073 SDC device state through read-only MCP resources and policy-checked, non-executing MCP tools. The artifact includes frozen agent evaluations and protocol, safety-boundary, lifecycle, mapping, audit, and authorization evidence. It is not validated for clinical use."
